{
  "$defs": {
    "AgentInfo": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One agent type: an ``agents/<name>.md`` file, valid or not.\n\n``wish`` is the model wish as written: ``cheapest``, ``same``, ``stronger``, a tier\nor a model. ``tools`` are the tool names the helper may use, empty for none. ``asks``\nis true when the helper may ask you a question. ``errors`` are what is wrong with\nthe file: a type with errors is never the one a name resolves to. ``shadowed`` lists\nthe origins of lower files of the same name that this one hides. ``trusted`` is\nfalse for a project agent in a folder that is not trusted, which is listed and\nnever started. ``used`` and ``finished`` count helpers of this type started and\nended in the last 30 days (``helper.ended``). ``finished`` is ``None`` when the\ndaemon cannot count them. ``stopped`` counts the ones of the last 30 days that ended\nearly, for any reason other than done; ``None`` when the daemon cannot count them.\n``cost_usd`` is what those helpers cost in the same days; ``None`` when the daemon\ncannot say. ``resolves_to`` is what ``wish`` becomes in this setup; ``None`` when the\ndaemon does not say.\n\n``path`` is the agent's file: ``~`` stands for the home folder, a bundled file is its\npackage path (``golem/agents/bundled/explorer.md``) and a project file is relative to the\nproject. ``text`` is the whole file as written and ``prompt`` is its body. Both are\n``None`` for a project agent in a folder that is not trusted. ``changing_tools`` are the\n``tools`` that change things; the rest only read. ``unavailable`` says in plain words why\nthe agent cannot be started now, the same text ``delegate`` refuses with, and is ``None``\nwhen it can. An older daemon leaves out every field from ``resolves_to`` on.",
      "properties": {
        "asks": {
          "default": false,
          "title": "Asks",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "changing_tools": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Changing Tools",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "cost_usd": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Cost Usd"
        },
        "description": {
          "title": "Description",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "errors": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Errors",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "finished": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Finished"
        },
        "limits": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/AgentLimits"
        },
        "name": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "origin": {
          "enum": [
            "bundled",
            "user",
            "project"
          ],
          "title": "Origin",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "path": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Path"
        },
        "prompt": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Prompt"
        },
        "resolves_to": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/WishResolution"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null
        },
        "shadowed": {
          "items": {
            "enum": [
              "bundled",
              "user",
              "project"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Shadowed",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "stopped": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Stopped"
        },
        "text": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Text"
        },
        "tools": {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Tools",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "trusted": {
          "default": true,
          "title": "Trusted",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "unavailable": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Unavailable"
        },
        "used": {
          "default": 0,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Used",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "wish": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Wish",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name",
        "description",
        "origin",
        "wish"
      ],
      "title": "AgentInfo",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "AgentLimits": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "What bounds one helper of this type. ``None`` means the file sets no limit of that kind.\n\n``max_seconds`` is working time: it does not count the time spent waiting for\nyou, for a slot or for a provider. ``answer_chars`` cuts the helper's final answer.",
      "properties": {
        "answer_chars": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Answer Chars"
        },
        "max_calls": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Calls"
        },
        "max_cost_usd": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Cost Usd"
        },
        "max_seconds": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Seconds"
        },
        "max_tokens": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Max Tokens"
        }
      },
      "title": "AgentLimits",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "WishResolution": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "What a type's wish becomes in this setup.\n\n``model`` is the model the wish picks now and ``tier`` its tier. ``reason`` is one plain\nline on why, at most 200 characters. ``fresh_window`` is true when the helper starts\nwith an empty context window on that model. Every field may be left out.",
      "properties": {
        "fresh_window": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Fresh Window"
        },
        "model": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 200,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Model"
        },
        "reason": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "maxLength": 200,
              "minLength": 1,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Reason"
        },
        "tier": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "enum": [
                "local",
                "budget",
                "frontier"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Tier"
        }
      },
      "title": "WishResolution",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "``agent`` is the type the name means now, such as the bundled one that the deleted file\nhid, or ``None`` when no agent has the name any more.",
  "properties": {
    "agent": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/AgentInfo"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null
    }
  },
  "title": "AgentsDeleteResult",
  "type": "object"
}
